nts","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","review_id":"s8Lrfc_g9SX39lYwv3gxnA","date":"2015-12-18T21:16:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9318750500679016,"text_excerpt":"Loved this little place! I work on Royal, so I've been trying to find a cute getaway for lunch that isn't super crowded. Little Vic's fits my needs perfectly! I had the BBQ sandwich, which was great, and my boyfriend had the Sicilian hot dog, which is basically a calzone with a hot dog in it (which is obviously amazing!). We split a side of risotto and loved every minute of it. Incredibly reasonable prices, which I didn't think were possible in the French Quarter. A good amount of food for your buck, and a cozy, eclectic atmosphere to boot! After lunch, peruse their many flavors of gelato to find something perfect to hit that sweet spot! Since it was chilly, we opted for a gorgeous chocol..."},{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","review_id":"nRHoOK96_km8rr3dxINmfg","date":"2013-10-03T01:35:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9312649369239807,"text_excerpt":"Very friendly staff and awesome gelato! There is a good variety of flavors to choose from too. The cool guy that was assisting me let me sample all the flavors so I could decide on which one I like the most. The strawberry cheese cake was my favorite and is a must try if you visit. The court yard out back is beautiful as well so if you have the time you should check it out and enjoy the scenery a bit."},{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","review_id":"D0z4EyPSD0grl-0SxyULSw","date":"2016-03-23T04:59:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9268568158149719,"text_excerpt":"Came here with the taste of nawlins food tour.. Wasn't a super fan of the sandwich that we got? Kinda plain.. However... The patio was really cute, probably the most pleasant and super clean bathroom.. AND the ice cream/gelato was phenomenal!! Got the Kings cake.. Amazing! Every time we walked past the place the rest of our stay my mouth water and I got sad we didn't have time to stop and wait in the line for some more! You must try the gelato!!!! (The couple near us had pizza, was wishing that's what we were about to try.. The sandwiches were too unfulfilling)."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","photo_id":"YVkvpBgGc-jaT9eyvde7qw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YVkvpBgGc-jaT9eyvde7qw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8628154397010803},{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","photo_id":"CZ-TtO2dhT2Sm-IVtKC-EQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CZ-TtO2dhT2Sm-IVtKC-EQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8549658060073853},{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","photo_id":"LVXUzGtxlolX8v0OLZ7YAg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LVXUzGtxlolX8v0OLZ7YAg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8440437316894531},{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","photo_id":"0_237z7qKXUnzClE75xlDA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0_237z7qKXUnzClE75xlDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7740263342857361},{"business_id":"_-otZU2dbPrEZyaVSMmvDg","photo_id":"oZrTCwdjHYML0Mvp5e3UCA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oZrTCwdjHYML0Mvp5e3UCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7502783536911011}]},"notebook_case":null}
